                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Attractive, alluring, tempting."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f03c7104-ca64-4303-98e6-379ef4c08dd8",
                                                "sense_id": "48d2dcb7-256d-322d-a403-7fdd0aa834d8",
                                                "text": "Evil is said to be seductive, which is one reason why people do what they know they shouldn't."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9171b75d-5af8-4fef-8c01-ecf377523c0b",
                                                "sense_id": "48d2dcb7-256d-322d-a403-7fdd0aa834d8",
                                                "text": "The most rapid and most seductive transition in all human nature is that which attends the palliation of a ravenous appetite. There is something humiliating about it.[…]Can those harmless but refined fellow-diners be the selfish cads whose gluttony and personal appearance so raised your contemptuous wrath on your arrival?"
                                            }
